6.5 Copilot Studio Agent Guideline
To make it easy for MTTs to create the demo agent in their environment, we will provide the Power Apps solution export.

- Create one solution per demo agent.
- When creating solution, follow the naming convention detailed below.
- Set the solution as default to ensure the agent is created in this solution.
- After testing, export the solution and check it in the repo
- In the agent README file, provide an overview of the agent configuration, steps to import and complete the setup.
- Try to use Dataverse and file as the data source and tools, so we can reduce the environment complexity.

